  "title": "Quick Garlicky Indian Chickpeas Toast",
  "description": "A garlicky, crisp, and Whole30-friendly Indian dish featuring chickpeas and hail is not used, instead whole wheat toast is used, this Gujarati-inspired recipe is perfect for a quick snack or meal prep",
